<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!Lead.FirstName},</font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">As promised, here is contact info for one of best lenders. Your next step is to complete the online application for financing. Once you are pre-approved, we will be ready to start building your portfolio together.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><a href="versolis.com"><br></a></font></div><div style=""><b style=""><font color="#3333ff"><a href="versolis.com">Please use the link included in Teresa Waters' contact info&nbsp;</a></font></b><span style="font-size: 12pt;">below and complete the application. Teresa's team will reach out to you within 48 hours of receiving your application to introduce themselves and help you obtain the financing approval.</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Let me know as soon as you receive your approval for financing, and schedule a call with me using the link in my email as soon you are approved so that we can begin review properties as the become available.</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Thanks,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Ashley&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; b